        },
        "quote": "(b) Any deed for the dedication of a new public street shall not be filed with the Register of Deeds until such deed shall have endorsed on it the fact that it has been submitted to and has been approved by the Planning Commission and has been accepted by the City Council.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.250:block:1#text",
