        "quote": "(c) Any deed for the dedication or easement of additional right-of-way which is necessary to facilitate any public works project on an existing street or public way may be filed with the Register of Deeds without the endorsement of the Planning Commission and acceptance by the City Council. (Code 1981 § 41-72. Code 1995 § 134-104.)",
